  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A quick thrust to the upper part of your arm damages the deltoid muscle and causes your hand to spasm as the large nerve descending from the brachial plexus is temporarily stunned from the blow.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}. Also, gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1) and pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test to avoid dropping whatever you held in that hand.</p>"
    },
